    "outputMaxVoltageV": null,
    "inputSchmitt": false,
    "notes": "Bus driver: sink 50 mA at 0.5 V (32 mA at 0.4 V), source -10.4 mA at 2.4 V (DS88xx). Receiver output: IOL 16 mA at 0.4 V, IOH -5.2 mA at 2.4 V. Bus pin leakage 80 uA max, also with VCC = 0 V."
  },
